Deliberately empty.

Uploaded media does NOT live here — it goes to MEDIA_ROOT (default
./var/media), outside the web root, and is served by app/api/media/[...key]
after an access check. Anything placed in this folder is served statically
to anyone with the URL, no session required.

This file exists so the directory survives a clone: the Dockerfile copies
public/ into the runtime image.
